                "loc": "GEN.46.8+GEN.46.9+GEN.46.10+GEN.46.11+GEN.46.12+GEN.46.13+GEN.46.14+GEN.46.15+GEN.46.16+GEN.46.17+GEN.46.18+GEN.46.19+GEN.46.20+GEN.46.21+GEN.46.22+GEN.46.23+GEN.46.24+GEN.46.25+GEN.46.26+GEN.46.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 46.8-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kuna inkarn oo layiok le Yakobo ooetuo apa Misiri te nebo ninye, oltung'ani ake o lmarei lenye: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruben o Simion o Lawi o Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isakar o Sebulon o Benchamen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dan o Naftali, Gad o Asheri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eishoi pooki e Yakobo naa iltung'ana ntomoni naapishana; netii Yosef apa laa obo lenye ina kata Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neye Yosef o lalashera lenyena pooki, o ina ishoi pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Iat 7.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake ore apa eishoi e Israel naa kebul oleng neponari aaku kumok; neponari ninche neaku olosho ogol; neaku ore ina kop ninche oobore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Iat 7.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitokini aaput likae aiguanani te Misiri lemeyiolo Yosef. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye iltung'ana lenyena, “Ng'ura, eikumok oleng iltung'ana loo Siraeli, negol oleng te iyiook. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Iat 7.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wootu, maing'uraki ninche olosek, pee mebul ake, pee te nelo ake nikitum olarrabal, neibung'are ilmang'ati lang neing'ar iyook paa keisik te nkop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku kepik ilaitasheikinok ooitasheiki ninche pee eisilisil ninche te sinkaisho nagol; neshetaki Farao nkanas naashumishoreki naaji Pisom o Ramases. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore anaa enaibookini ninche enkop, neponari neidapashakino enkop. Nejing iltung'ana le Misiri enkuretisho too ltung'ana loo Siraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eisho ninche iltung'ana loo Siraeli meisiaaisho to sina sapuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepik enkishui enye emion te sinkaisho nagol, te nturoto o too soito, o too mpukunot pooki e siaai ti ong'ata; ore too siaitin enye pooki neisho ninche meisiaaisho te sinkaisho nagol.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ilo aiguanani le Misiri ajoki inkaitoyiok oo Lhebrania, aa keji nabo Shifra neji enkae Pua, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ti nintoishosho nkituaak oo Lhebrania nidolidolo ina kata eisho, tenaa enkayioni niariara ninye metua; kake tenaa entito enchoo eton eishu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake keure apa nena aitoyiok Enkai, neitu eas anaa enaitanapa ninche olaiguanani le Misiri, kake eishoo inkayiok etoni eishu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa eipoto olaiguanani le Misiri nena aitoyiok, nejoki ninche, “Kainyoo pee itaasa ena, ninchosho nkayiok eishu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki nena aitoyiok Farao, “Enkaraki nemetiu nkituaak oo Lhebrania anaa nkituaak oo Lmisiri; amu kegol nkituaak oo Lhebrania oishuaa, naa keisho eton eitu ebau enkaitoyioni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitaas Enkai esidai nena aitoyiok; neponari iltung'ana aagolu neaku kumok oleng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki naure nena aitoyiok Enkai neisho ninche ilmareita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Iat 7.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitoki Farao aitanap iltung'ana lenyena pooki ajo, “Ore pooki ayioni naini too Lhebrania ninang'akiki olkeju oji Nail, kake enchoo intoyie eishu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
